WEBVTT

00:05:28.636 --> 00:05:31.436
Some countries have shut down,

00:05:31.436 --> 00:05:34.396
or are planning to shut down,
their coal plants.,

00:05:34.996 --> 00:05:38.316
Others are frantically planning
to build coal plants.

00:05:38.716 --> 00:05:40.596
Once a coal plant is built,

00:05:40.636 --> 00:05:43.876
it becomes part of the energy
system for decades.

00:05:44.516 --> 00:05:49.396
But our experience shows
that resistance is possible.

00:05:49.396 --> 00:05:50.636
How?

00:05:50.676 --> 00:05:54.476
By bringing into the conversation
the adverse impacts

00:05:54.476 --> 00:05:56.916
and externalities of coal plants.

00:05:57.396 --> 00:06:01.316
Secondly, also by providing
clean alternatives,